  "description": "SignalFlux.SignalProcessing provides signal-processing operations for Signal<T>: FFT/spectrum analysis, peak detection, PSD (incl. Welch), envelope (Hilbert), FIR/IIR filters, wavelet transforms, and denoising. Spectral math wraps Math.NET Numerics; filtering, wavelets, and periodograms wrap NWaves.",
  "id": "SignalFlux.SignalProcessing",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-19T21:13:09.647Z",
