  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/teklot/signalflux",
  "published": "2026-10-19T21:09:18.55Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- FIR / IIR filters: LowPass, HighPass, BandPass, BandStop (Butterworth, Bessel, Chebyshev I/II, Elliptic design) via NWaves 64-bit filtering\n      - Savitzky-Golay denoise filter\n      - Hilbert-transform envelope (replaces the 0.8.0 moving-max envelope)\n      - Welch's method PSD with power-of-two segments and Hann/Blackman/etc. windows (replaces the one-sided |F|^2 / N estimate)\n      - Wavelet transforms (Haar, Daubechies, Coiflet, Symlet) and wavelet threshold denoising",
